    "type": "question",
    "label": "17",
    "prompt": "Find the two numbers whose sum is 138 and whose difference is 88.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "113 and 25.",
      "worked": "Let the larger number be $x$ and the smaller number be $y$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x+y&=138 &&\\text{(1)}\\\\x-y&=88 &&\\text{(2)}\\end{align*}$$\nAdding equations (1) and (2):\n$$\\begin{align*}2x&=226\\\\x&=113\\end{align*}$$\nSubstituting into equation (1):\n$$\\begin{align*}113+y&=138\\\\y&=25\\end{align*}$$\nThe numbers are 113 and 25.\n\nCheck: $113+25=138$ and $113-25=88$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
